{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52387","headline":"回波乐 三十 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 三十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"他见见我见，我见见他见。\n二见亦自见，不见喜中面。\n手把车钏镜，终日向外看。\n唯见他长短，不肯自洮练（项校「拣」）。\n竟竟口合合，犹如冶排扇。\n逢人即作动，心舌常交战。\n不肯自看身，看身善不善。\n如此痴冥人，只是可恶贱。\n劝君学修道，含食但自㖶。\n且拔己饥渴，五邪邪毒箭。\n获得身中病，应时乃一现。\n安住解脱中，无碍未别见。\n住是分别有，任用法界遍。\n纵起六十二，非由无罪（项校「最」）殿。\n所以得如斯，有大善方便。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52387.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52387","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}